{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A racing game truly like no other. Faster, tighter and more challenging than anything before it, Fluid Drift seeks to refresh the genre; giving racers something new that will push them further. With simple, stunning visuals and a beat-laden soundtrack, this game will make you rethink what you know about how to race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid Drift is about feel. Fluid Drift is about flow. It's about hitting that one single perfect line faster than your brain can think yet somehow doing it without thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The pinnacle of drift racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piloting a drift craft is no easy feat - you'll need to have impeccable timing and incredible reflexes to progress.\u00a0 Controlled either by controller or mouse and keyboard, Fluid Drift handles more closely to a space-based dog-fighting game than a traditional racer.\u00a0 Yet the tracks themselves are truly unforgiving - with incredibly tight sections that are almost puzzle-like.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608320?t=1748557143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608320?t=1748557143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608320/d2aaa1adb5c3bb49b7564d1ad8c87fd9c5b2276f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748557143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608320/d2aaa1adb5c3bb49b7564d1ad8c87fd9c5b2276f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748557143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A racing game truly like no other. Faster, tighter and more challenging than anything before it, Fluid Drift seeks to refresh the genre; giving racers something new that will push them further. With simple, stunning visuals and a beat-laden soundtrack, this game will make you rethink what you know about how to race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid Drift is about feel. Fluid Drift is about flow. It's about hitting that one single perfect line faster than your brain can think yet somehow doing it without thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The pinnacle of drift racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piloting a drift craft is no easy feat - you'll need to have impeccable timing and incredible reflexes to progress.\u00a0 Controlled either by controller or mouse and keyboard, Fluid Drift handles more closely to a space-based dog-fighting game than a traditional racer.\u00a0 Yet the tracks themselves are truly unforgiving - with incredibly tight sections that are almost puzzle-like.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Gusbo"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608320/f0a609a9b9d5d5e8dcc79432ecb82e687c7bed20/header.jpg?t=1748557143","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 GusboGames and Angus Campbell-MacDonald. All Rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3608320/854295/6ec3c30f03bd02828fccf2773919bf149909688f/1750837069/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748557136","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3608320/854295/6ec3c30f03bd02828fccf2773919bf149909688f/1750837069/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748557136","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3608320/854295/6ec3c30f03bd02828fccf2773919bf149909688f/1750837069/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748557136","id":257116424,"name":"Fluid Drift: Pre-Alpha game trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116424/3bd93a66da5a65c84fabbcff1fe55ef490535c4f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748557136"},{"dash_av1":"htt